Package: BayesOptR
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Optimization with Targeted Blocking and Parallel Batch Acquisition
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Masuzyo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "masuzyo@example.com")
    )
Description: Advanced Bayesian Optimization framework implementing Gaussian Process, 
    Student-t Process, and Adaptive Hybrid Bayesian Optimization with Student-t 
    Expected Improvement. Features include targeted blocking strategies (dimension-wise 
    and distance-based, both hard/soft variants), local penalization, constant liar 
    heuristics, and comprehensive parallelization support for batch acquisition in 
    high-dimensional optimization problems.
